-- Creates test logins  john / john-test-123  and  dino / dino-test-123.  Wipe it all with reset-ledger-data.sql before real money.
-- Entries carry the simulated 2026 dates, so charts and lock-ups look real. If no manager exists yet it creates  raf / admin-test-123  (change it in the app!).
